vela-apps — Third-Party Component Notices
=========================================

vela-apps is a composite work. It combines original code written for the
riscv-vela project with code derived from the Keystone enclave project,
including the smaller third-party libraries that Keystone bundles.

Scope of the top-level LICENSE
------------------------------
The top-level LICENSE file (BSD-2-Clause-Patent) applies to original work
authored for this repository, namely:

  * Files in examples/ that do not carry another copyright notice
    (see section 3).
  * reri register generator/
  * Build scripts, documentation and configuration at the repository root.

Where a component directory carries its own license file, that file governs
the contents of that directory and takes precedence over the top-level
LICENSE. Per-file SPDX-License-Identifier tags and license notices, where
present, are authoritative and take precedence over both.


